{"id":"2960b6da0bc3b9f4","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-measure10-essential-supremum-bound.md","title":"ZFC Measure10 Essential Supremum Bound","display":"df-zfc-measure10-essential-supremum-bound — ZFC Measure10 Essential Supremum Bound","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure10-essential-supremum-bound","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure10-essential-supremum-bound"],"display":"df-zfc-measure10-essential-supremum-bound — ZFC Measure10 Essential Supremum Bound","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure10-essential-supremum-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure10-essential-supremum-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure10-essential-supremum-bound — ZFC Measure10 Essential Supremum Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b,f,X,\\mu \\in V\">\\(b,f,X,\\mu \\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10EssentialSupremumBound}_S \\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10EssentialSupremumBound}_S \\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}essential\\text{-}supremum\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10EssentialSupremumBound}_S(b,f,X,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^X\\land b\\in[0,\\infty)\\land\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|&gt;b\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|&gt;b\\})=0\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}essential\\text{-}supremum\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10EssentialSupremumBound}_S(b,f,X,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^X\\land b\\in[0,\\infty)\\land\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|&gt;b\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|&gt;b\\})=0\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|f|\">\\(|f|\\)</span> 的本质上界，当且仅当超出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 的可测集合为零测集。</li>\n<li>显式要求测度空间、实值函数、非负界以及例外集的可测性，避免对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 的定义域之外集合求值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3$（见 [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"b,f,X,\\mu \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10EssentialSupremumBound}_S \\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}essential\\text{-}supremum\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10EssentialSupremumBound}_S(b,f,X,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^X\\land b\\in[0,\\infty)\\land\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|>b\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|>b\\})=0\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"|f|","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":1219,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2541","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure10-essential-supremum-bound.md|58-df-zfc-measure10-essential-supremum-bound]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca832ed6bc22f728"]}